## Summary
장동혁 proposed a reform titled 'Party Member Sovereignty 2.0' aimed at enhancing party member rights by allowing direct elections for city/provincial party chairpersons and party chapter chairpersons.

## Key Points
- Introduction of 'Party Member Sovereignty 2.0' as a political reform concept.
- Party members will directly elect city/provincial party chairpersons.
- Party members will directly elect party chapter chairpersons.


